{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the `timetable-helper` Skill to answer this timetable request: CSE-B Thursday\n\n- Expect a batch (for example `CSE-A`) and a weekday. If either is missing, ask for it instead of guessing.\n- Run the Skill's lookup script and show the result as a table with Time, Course, Room and Faculty columns.\n- If no rows come back, say there are no classes for that batch and day. Do not invent any.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e7fcc2ba-7e81-4ee1-8d5c-ea0e54f1708b","uuid":"7d8bbd9f-6bd5-4651-b667-0a94834113af","timestamp":"2026-11-18T08:43:45.539Z","isSynthetic":true}
